OL,3,GNEWSABowel cancer campaign aims to
OL,4,Aboost early diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FBowel Cancer UK is launching a new
OL,7,Fprogramme in Cornwall aimed at helping
OL,8,Fmore people get diagnosed earlier.
OL,10,FThe 12-month scheme, funded by the
OL,11,FBowelbabe Fund for Cancer Research UK,
OL,12,Fwill run in Penzance, Redruth, Camborne
OL,13,Fand Hayle alongside pharmacies and
OL,14,Fhealthcare professionals.
OL,16,FBowel Cancer UK said almost half of
OL,17,Fbowel cancer cases in the UK were
OL,18,Fdiagnosed in the later stages of the
OL,19,Fdisease, when treatment could be more
OL,20,Fdifficult.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
