OL,3,GNEWSABowel cancer campaign aims to
OL,4,Aboost early diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Glyde, strategy, impact and
OL,7,Finsight lead at the charity, said some
OL,8,Fpeople were reluctant to seek help,
OL,9,Fadding: "We want more people in
OL,10,FCornwall to be diagnosed earlier, when
OL,11,Fbowel cancer is more treatable and
OL,12,Foutcomes are better."
